data: {"id": "74ab5a4fcaa24df1-thinking-layer-372", "run_id": "74ab5a4fcaa24df1", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "当前集群中发现 1 个异常 Pod：\n\n*   **异常 Pod**: `aiops-case-03` 命名空间下的 `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w`\n*   **当前状态**: `ContainerCreating`\n*   **异常类型**: `VolumeMountFailed` (兼容 `L0` 级，对应 Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 且卷挂载或绑定失败)\n\n**异常分组 (`abnormal_groups`)**:\n1.  **`vol_mount_failed_aiops_case_03`**: 由 `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 构成，该 Pod 长时间处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，疑似卷挂载失败。\n\n**下一步**: 需根据 Runbook `pod-volume-mount-failed.md` 获取该 Pod 的 Events 详情以确认具体挂载错误原因。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788416036930}

