ronment:  <none>\n    Mounts:\nVolumes:\n  input:\n    Type:        ConfigMap (a volume populated by a ConfigMap)\n    Name:        unavailable-config\n    Optional:    false\nEvents:\n  Warning  FailedMount  36s                  kubelet            Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition\n  Warning  FailedMount  31s (x9 over 2m38s)  kubelet            MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found\n关键状态/事件:", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/74ab5a4fcaa24df1-g1/tools/006-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/74ab5a4fcaa24df1-g1/tools/006-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/74ab5a4fcaa24df1-g1/tools/006-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

