data: {"id": "74ab5a4fcaa24df1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1474", "run_id": "74ab5a4fcaa24df1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 本轮调查结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 处于 **Pending** 状态，Container 状态为 **ContainerCreating**（未启动）。\n2. **根因事件**：Events 中反复出现两条 Warning：\n   - `FailedMount`：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（31s 起，x9 次，持续 2m38s）\n   - `FailedMount`：`Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]`（36s）\n3. **容器日志**：`kubectl logs` 返回 `BadRequest: container \"app\" in pod \"workload-5b5fc82w\" is waiting to start: Co", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788416083432, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

